**CRITICAL: UNWIND array syntax rules (MUST follow exactly):**
- Keys MUST be unquoted: {{node_id: "value"}} ✓ CORRECT
- Keys MUST NOT have double quotes: {{"node_id": "value"}} ✗ WRONG
